      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Lake_Darby%2C_Ohio",
      "category": "other",
      "quality": "poor",
      "qualityReason": "location_description"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "Big Darby Creek forms Lake Darby's western border and also marks the line between Franklin and Madison counties.",
